{"id":"otnyne","lemma":"отныне","pos":"adv","rank":1983,"glosses":["henceforth, henceforward, from now on"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d1/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%BD%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%BD%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Отныне ты один из нас.","en":"From now on, you're one of us.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"from / out of"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"}]},{"text":"Отныне она была вне опасности.","en":"She was now out of danger.","words":[null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"out of, outside"},{"g":"danger, peril","l":"опасность"}]},{"text":"Отныне будь осторожнее.","en":"From now on, be more careful.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Отныне ты должен заниматься прилежнее.","en":"You'll have to study harder from now on.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"to study, to learn"},null]},{"text":"Отныне тебе нужно быть осторожным.","en":"You must be careful from now on.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"to be"},null]}]}